  !>
  !>     \details
  !>     The syrStridedBatched functions perform the matrix-vector operations:
  !>
  !>         A[i] := A[i] + alpha*x[i]*x[i]**T
  !>
  !>     where ``alpha`` is a scalar, ``x`` is a pointer to an array of vectors, and ``A`` is an
