  !>     \details
  !>     The geamStridedBatched functions perform one of the batched matrix-matrix operations:
  !>
  !>         C_i = alpha*op( A_i ) + beta*op( B_i )  for i = 0, 1, ... batchCount - 1
  !>
  !>     where ``alpha`` and ``beta`` are scalars, ``op(A_i)``, ``op(B_i)``, and ``C_i`` are ``m``
  !>     by ``n`` matrices,
  !>     and ``op( X )`` is one of:
  !>
  !>         op( X ) = X      or
  !>         op( X ) = X**T
  !>
