  !>               - 'HIPBLAS_DIAG_NON_UNIT', A is non-unit triangular.
  !>               - 'HIPBLAS_DIAG_UNIT', A is unit triangular.
  !>     @param[in] n - [int]
  !>     @param[in] AP - device pointer pointing to address of first matrix A_1.
  !>     @param[in] lda - [int]
  !>               specifies the leading dimension of each A.
